<div class="header-card">
  <span class="badge badge-emerald">DAILY WORK & PROGRESS REPORT</span>
  <h1>Markaz Islamic Library & Knowledge Portal</h1>
  <p>Comprehensive System Optimization, Bug Fixes & UI/UX Transformation Report</p>
  <p style="margin-top: 6px; font-size: 9pt; color: #94a3b8;">Generated Date: 23 August 2026 | Subai Jamiat Ahle Hadees Mumbai / Markaz Library</p>
</div>

<h2>1. Executive Summary & Accomplishments</h2>
<p>Today, critical backend API 404/CORS errors, validation exceptions, role gating redirections, and front-end user experience across the <strong>Markaz Islamic Library</strong> portal were resolved and elevated to a production-ready standard.</p>

<div class="section-box">
  <h3>Key Achievements:</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>100% Elimination of API 404s:</strong> Correctly mounted and aliased role & permission routes (<code>/api/permissions/roles</code> and <code>/api/permissions/permissions</code>).</li>
    <li><strong>Role-Based Dynamic Access:</strong> Staff users (Mufti, Librarian, Welfare Officers) now automatically redirect to <code>/admin/dashboard</code> upon login with dynamic permission-filtered sidebar menus.</li>
    <li><strong>Excel Bulk Book Import Accelerated:</strong> Resolved CORS / 500 Network crashes during bulk import. 15+ book items now import in <strong>0.07 seconds</strong> with full transactional database rollbacks.</li>
    <li><strong>Crash-Proof Fatawa Submission:</strong> Fixed 422 Unprocessable Content and React child object rendering crashes with automated audit logs on answers/deletions.</li>
    <li><strong>Library Page Re-engineered:</strong> Created a unified, clutter-free <strong>Markaz Islamic Library</strong> hub featuring 5 interactive navigation tabs (All Books, Our Publications, Folders & Topics, Authors, Publishers).</li>
    <li><strong>Strict Publisher Filtering:</strong> Created exact-match filtering for <em>Markaz Dawah Islamic & Charitable Publications (مركز الدعوة الإسلامية والخيرية)</em>.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<h2>2. Detailed Feature & Technical Breakdown</h2>

<h3>A. Role & Permission Gating</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Backend Fix:</strong> Mounted <code>permission_controller.router</code> on prefix <code>/permissions</code> and root <code>/api</code> in <code>main.py</code>.</li>
  <li><strong>Access Control:</strong> Exported <code>ADMIN_ALLOWED_ROLES</code> and dynamic permission validation (<code>hasPermission()</code>) in <code>accessControl.js</code>.</li>
  <li><strong>Smart Redirection:</strong> Updated <code>Login.jsx</code> and <code>ProtectedRoute.jsx</code> so all authorized staff land directly on the admin dashboard.</li>
</ul>

<h3>B. Fatawa Question Submission & Audit Logging</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Error Sanitizer:</strong> Created <code>library-frontend/src/utils/errorMessage.js</code> to safely format FastAPI validation arrays into clean strings.</li>
  <li><strong>Mufti Action Logging:</strong> Added <code>create_log</code> calls to record <code>FATWA_ANSWERED</code> and <code>FATWA_DELETED</code> in the system security audit trail.</li>
</ul>

<h3>C. Excel Bulk Import Performance</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Payload Optimization:</strong> Replaced heavy <code>Book</code> response model with lightweight <code>BookSummary</code> in <code>book_schema.py</code>.</li>
  <li><strong>Database Batching:</strong> Removed slow per-record <code>db.refresh()</code> loops and added clean exception handling with <code>db.rollback()</code> in <code>book_management_controller.py</code>.</li>
</ul>

<h3>D. Library & Universal Search Redesign</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Search Bar:</strong> Removed box-inside-box nested borders and replaced them with a single, floating pill container with subtle glow in <code>LibrarySearchStrip.jsx</code>.</li>
  <li><strong>Universal Search Modal:</strong> Added dynamic rotating search placeholders (Bukhari, Fatawa, Education, Welfare drives, Authors) cycling every 3 seconds with an <code>ESC</code> badge.</li>
  <li><strong>Interactive Tabs:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>All Books:</strong> Complete catalog with language, category, and sorting filters.</li>
      <li><strong>Our Publications:</strong> Dedicated filter strictly displaying books published by <em>Markaz Dawah Islamic & Charitable (مركز الدعوة الإسلامية والخيرية)</em> with verified badges.</li>
      <li><strong>Folders & Topics:</strong> Visual topic cards (📁) with live book counts per category.</li>
      <li><strong>Authors Directory:</strong> Embedded authors index with instant book filtering.</li>
      <li><strong>Publishers Directory:</strong> Embedded publishing houses index with instant book filtering.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>

